# Everything this directory's tooling generates, declared HERE rather than in
# the repository root's file. Git resolves an anchored pattern relative to the
# `.gitignore` that declares it, so rules kept beside the subtree they govern
# keep meaning the right place when the subtree moves; the same rules written
# at the root as `tests/performance/...` stop matching the moment it does.
#
# Written by `playwright test --config=playwright.perf.config.ts` and read by
# the vitest regression gate. Not source artifacts.
/.report.json
/.run.json
/.cockpit-report/
